WEBVTT

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.080
He Frogs him good!

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.120
This was how he knocked him down the first time!

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:27.230
<i>I knocked down
 the champ again!</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.230
<i>I must be pretty
 damn good.</i>

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:35.230
<i>I don't have Takamura-san’s wild spirit or Ippo’s explosiveness.</i>

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:40.760
<i>I thought I was the baddest fighter in my 
neighborhood, but I was just a frog in the well.</i>

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:51.450
<i>But now that I've been around boxing specialists, this frog has learned how to survive.</i>

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:58.340
<i>My “new secret weapon” are those six years worth of survival tactics!</i>

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.150
<i>We can’t fly like birds.</i>

00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:05.160
<i>But we struggle and never give up.</i>

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:09.010
<i>We keep leaping toward the sun, 
even if we fail repeatedly!</i>

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:12.360
<i>Look.</i>

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:14.960
<i>It’s well within reach!</i>

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.460
<i>The belt's right in front of you!</i>

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.660
Whoa! The champion gets up at the eight count!

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:31.190
Can you fight?

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:36.470
He nods at the referee’s inquiry, and the fight continues!

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:39.010
<i>The belt was so close...</i>

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:42.010
<i>yet so far!</i>

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:43.840
He can do it!

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:47.100
The belt is his once he knocks him down again.

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:50.650
Why do you look so grim, Senpai?

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:52.390
Shouldn’t you be pleased?

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.900
The fact that he still got up was huge.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.020
You worry too much!

00:01:58.020 --> 00:01:59.550
Aoki-san will...

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:04.910
What? He’s out of steam?

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:09.070
A title match is twice as intense as any normal match.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:11.910
It makes a guy lose his stamina at an unbelievable rate.

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:15.110
And there’s the bell!

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.760
That’s the end of the sixth round!

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:19.950
The challenger looks up to the heavens wondering how he didn’t win.

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.920
There are only four rounds left! What ups and downs await us?

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:29.110
Imae’s certainly the worst off, but Aoki has never fought on this stage before.

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:32.180
If this match comes down to who can stick it out the longest...

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:34.650
A battle of wills, huh?

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.230
Aoki-san.

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:39.940
I'm glad you survived that. Now sit down.

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:43.660
<i>He’s good.</i>

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:46.650
<i>He’s definitely the best challenger I’ve ever faced.</i>

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:51.520
<i>He’s a self-made man just like me... 
but he's also not like me.</i>

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.150
<i>But in what way?</i>

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.460
Imae...  Imae! Do you hear me?

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.830
This fight is now a test of endurance!

00:02:57.830 --> 00:02:59.460
Think back to your grueling training!

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:03.970
Remember what you’re fighting for and fight for it!

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.560
<i>What I'm fighting for?</i>

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:11.010
<i>You kicked her to the curb?
Your goddess of victory?</i>

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:15.890
<i>I'll show you how powerful a guy can be when she's looking over him.</i>

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:18.280
<i>I see now.</i>

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:20.820
<i>That’s a huge difference!</i>

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.050
Aoki! The belt is all but yours!

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.610
I know it’s tough to win the title!

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:30.830
But you need to be strong, get over it, and...

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:36.870
<i>I didn’t need to tell him all that.</i>

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.920
Round seven!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.380
Yeah!

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.390
He got his energy back!

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:45.420
He has his game face on!

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:51.470
<i>Once I become the champion, treat me like a boss.</i>

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:53.900
<i>Fine.</i>

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.980
<i>I’ll do whatever you want.</i>

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:59.230
Snatch that belt! Go get him, Aoki!

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:02.230
You can do it, Aoki-san!

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:05.490
Don’t think of the consequences! Get in there!

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:07.120
You’re almost there!

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:08.240
Masaru!

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:12.410
The challenger is on the hunt for the title!

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:16.710
<i>What is he fighting for?</i>

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:19.920
<i>I can feel it directly through his gloves.</i>

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:23.470
<i>Those fists received strength and encouragement from someone.</i>

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.670
<i>Those fists are fighting for
 someone watching over them.</i>

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.760
<i>So what have  </i>I  <i>been fighting for?</i>

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.330
<i>To become the champion?</i>

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:34.260
<i>No.</i>

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:35.390
<i>That’s not it!</i>

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:38.340
<i>Don’t make fun of Sachiko!</i>

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.850
<i>Kacchan...</i>

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:42.400
<i>I remember.</i>

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:45.030
<i>Sorry, Sachiko.</i>

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:47.690
<i>If only I were stronger...</i>

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.490
<i>Sachiko...</i>

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:55.740
<i>What do you think? Looking good?</i>

00:04:57.410 --> 00:05:00.540
<i>Don’t overdo it for my sake.</i>

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:02.980
<i>Sachiko, it was for  </i>your <i>sake!</i>

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.090
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:07.980
<i>Dammit! Dammit!</i>

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.870
<i>Why don’t we get away for a while?</i>

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.760
<i>Get away? Not a chance!</i>

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:13.090
<i>I’ll practice more than anyone!</i>

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:21.980
<i>You're bothering me!</i>

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.430
<i>I need to concentrate for my match!</i>

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:26.860
<i>Quit hanging around me!</i>

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.600
<i>Don’t ever come to see me!</i>

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:43.120
The champion clinches yet again in this round!

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:44.970
Trade punches like a man!

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:46.150
That's cheating!

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:47.630
And you call yourself a champion?

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.350
<i>Sachiko...</i>

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:55.680
<i>I started boxing for your sake, yet...</i>

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.970
<i>I tossed you aside.</i>

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:00.690
<i>I willfully divorced myself from you.</i>

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:09.020
A body blow! The champion pitches forward!

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.780
<i>I’m following him...</i>

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:18.660
<i>and I can’t stop it!</i>

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.950
<i>You can’t fight it.</i>

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:23.750
<i>A man’s instinct is not immune against this move!</i>

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:28.210
<i>So here, take a good look at what’s over there...</i>

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:30.550
<i>Your hell!</i>

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:32.130
<i>Th-There it is!</i>

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:32.840
<i>His Look-Away!</i>

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:36.340
<i>Imae will eat this Frog Punch unguarded.</i>

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:37.800
<i>He won!</i>

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:44.830
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:47.290
<i>Imae-san is not looking away!</i>

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:50.610
<i>He didn’t take the bait? But why?</i>

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:02.490
<i>S... Sachiko!</i>

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.100
<i>Why is Sachiko here?</i>

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.050
<i>What is she praying for?</i>

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:10.000
<i>Kacchan!</i>

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:13.420
<i>Is she...  actually...</i>

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:15.510
<i>praying for me?</i>

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:18.450
<i>She's always so humble.</i>

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:21.270
<i>She would always worry about me,</i>

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:22.990
<i>support me,</i>

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:24.810
<i>and watch over me.</i>

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:25.830
<i>She’s my...</i>

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:29.100
<i>goddess!</i>

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:36.150
You dumbass!

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:38.530
He’s still going for the Frog Punch!

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:41.820
<i>The belt’s mine now! Take this!</i>

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:45.790
<i>Why? Why isn’t he looking away?</i>

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.710
<i>I’ll never avert my eyes again!</i>

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:49.790
<i>Not after seeing what's dear to me!</i>

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.790
<i>God, please connect!</i>

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.360
The Frog Punch completely misses its mark!

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:59.820
He leaps with all his might, but it doesn’t connect!

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:01.300
He just flies through the air!

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:04.850
<i>All that power gave him too much motion! Crap!</i>

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:08.610
A right!

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.560
He shoots down the Frog right in midair!

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.310
He makes a nosedive for the mat!

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:13.870
Masaru!

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.820
<i>Asshole!</i>

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:20.700
<i>I ain’t going down!</i>

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.870
<i>The belt’s all but mine! I ain’t giving up!</i>

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:27.910
<i>Amazing. Is this the strength you get from being watched over?</i>

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.710
He punches from an awkward position!

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:35.210
<i>I once cowered in the face of this intensity.</i>

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:38.430
<i>But now I realize a simple fact.</i>

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:39.970
<i>Something he showed me.</i>

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:43.300
<i>A man can keep going if
 someone watches over him.</i>

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:47.430
<i>I thought I couldn’t reach the top without sacrificing something.</i>

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:51.810
<i>But he rose up while retaining everything.</i>

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.860
<i>He's not a boxer as far as I'm concerned.</i>

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:57.900
<i>I’m not going to lose to him!</i>

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:00.900
<i>I was jealous of him!</i>

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:05.940
<i>He taught me, the hard way,</i>

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:09.290
<i>that a man is strong if he has someone to lean on!</i>

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:13.750
<i>I have no choice but to respect him!</i>

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:21.050
<i>I’m not giving up until the very last second!</i>

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:23.050
<i>I’ll be the champ!</i>

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:27.560
<i>I will conquer this formidable man and 
reunite with Sachiko with renewed pride!</i>

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:32.100
Those were too light!

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:35.560
Those two are completely and utterly exhausted!

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:39.070
If you can’t deliver a finishing blow, hit him till he falls!

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:40.590
Mind over matter!

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:42.820
Keep hitting him and let your spirit do all the work!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:49.680
We’re now seeing a tremendous slugfest in the middle of the ring!

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:51.000
Nope, more of a slapfest!

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:54.420
The weak sounds of the gloves tapping fill the arena!

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:57.920
The hits keep coming, never stopping for a second, yet...

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:59.670
neither fighter gives up!

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:03.070
Neither stands down as they keep punching!

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:16.150
They fell over, but it’s not a down!

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:17.980
They slipped and fell while grappling each other!

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:20.650
The mat is covered with their sweat!

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:23.220
Both faces are so swollen you
 can barely recognize them!

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.660
Both boxers are literally going in slow motion!

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:28.710
It’s like both those guys are slogging through mud!

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:30.540
Yeah, a real <i>slogfest.</i>

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:31.910
Screw this.

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:33.970
We know how this is gonna end.

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:35.920
If it comes to a decision, they both lose.

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:37.830
He’s so hot.

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.770
He’s “hot”?

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:42.890
Do you know what “hot” even looks like?

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:44.670
No, he’s hot.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:49.250
He may not fight like you or Ippo-kun.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.430
But he gives it his all just like the both of you!

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:56.220
I don’t care who wins or loses,
 he’s the hottest man around!

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:00.830
Less than 20 seconds left in the last round!

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:05.240
This match has been a give-and-take of knockdowns, but will it come to a decision?

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:09.200
The curtains are about to close on these ten long rounds!

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.830
Oh! A downward right!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:16.830
The challenger’s falling! We've been waiting for this development!

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:19.700
<i>Crap! I can’t keep myself up!</i>

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.340
<i>I’m going down!</i>

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:23.880
<i>Masaru... Masaru!</i>

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:26.340
<i>Huh?</i>

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:28.820
<i>His jaw's wide open!</i>

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:31.620
<i>Right there! If I can put my fists up there...</i>

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.680
<i>Right in front of me!</i>

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.600
<i>Put your fists up! Snatch that belt!</i>

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:39.420
<i>You legs better do as I say!</i>

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.310
<i>Brace yourselves! Move!</i>

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:43.730
<i>Remember our six years together!</i>

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:47.060
<i>Remember how we ran every goddamn day!</i>

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:47.900
<i>Six years!</i>

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.700
<i>Every day...</i>

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.280
<i>Every day!</i>

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:57.470
He’s still up!

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:59.810
He braces himself just shy of the mat!

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:02.410
And now he’s about to...

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.720
<i>He’s Frogging him? In that condition?</i>

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.220
<i>Can he do it?</i>

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:11.800
<i>You can do it! Come on!</i>

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:14.170
<i>You didn’t box six years for nothing!</i>

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:16.470
<i>You can do it, Masaru. You can do it!</i>

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:18.690
<i>I’ve always believed</i>

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:22.290
<i>that I’ll reach the sun if I just keep leaping!</i>

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:24.530
<i>You see that? It’s right in front of you!</i>

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:27.440
<i>If you reach out with your hands, you’ll grab the belt!</i>

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:30.700
Go for it, Aoki!

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:35.410
<i>Almost there!</i>

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:39.960
He connects!

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.030
It’s a clean hit on the champion’s chin!

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:44.460
But...

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:46.740
that was only a small hop!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.460
It was only a Half Frog!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.740
He had nothing.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:55.130
That would have been a perfect
 punch if he wasn’t so spent!

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:57.190
But it still left a mark!

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:06.130
Both fighters fall, one on top of the other!

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:07.400
They’re out of strength!

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:10.270
They’ve exhausted every last drop!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:14.920
The bell signals the end of the match!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:18.290
This fierce struggle will come down to a decision!

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:20.510
You did great in this slogfest!

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:22.000
You’re both champs!

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.960
You did great, Imae.

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.960
You kicked butt, Aoki!

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.620
That was a great fight.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.420
You think so?

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:35.810
What’s wrong? You ain’t gonna clap?

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:36.970
It’s not over.

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:42.730
Masaru’s fight is not over until we hear the decision.

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:46.020
I’m pooped.

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:46.980
Kimura-san?

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:50.450
What do you guys think, objectively?

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:52.180
You mean the decision?

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.120
I think they’re really close on points.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:59.110
I want Aoki-san to win! I want him to be the champion!

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:02.000
Hmph, "Aoki" and "champion" don't go together.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:06.280
<i>Aoki has a one-point lead in my book.</i>

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:09.050
<i>Please agree with me, you judges!</i>

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.760
<i>Let Aoki win!</i>

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.440
They've finished their scoring.

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:16.760
The decisions will now be read!

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:24.770
Judge Uchida!

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:27.170
95 to 94!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.270
Imae!

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:29.770
Yes!

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:33.470
<i>Is he blind?!</i>

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.570
<i>Aoki won by a hair!</i>

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:37.280
Judge Morita!

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:40.300
95 to 94!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.340
Aoki!

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:43.540
Masaru!

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:44.790
All right!

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:47.810
Holy cow! It’s a split decision!

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:49.040
But it’s only by a narrow margin.

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:52.550
To which player will the last judge give his decision?

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:55.090
Will it be Imae? Or Aoki?

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:57.560
Which one will get the belt?

00:14:57.560 --> 00:14:58.090
And it’s...

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:01.560
Referee Shimakawa!

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:04.560
94 to...

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:07.410
<i>How much? How many points?</i>

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:08.820
<i>Tell us already!</i>

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:10.060
<i>M-My stomach hurts.</i>

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:13.070
<i>Please make my Masaru the champion!</i>

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:20.090
<i>I have no regrets. We slugged it out till the end.</i>

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:21.800
<i>The results don’t matter.</i>

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:24.730
<i>Did I make it?</i>

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.080
<i>Have I reached the belt?</i>

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:32.840
94 to...

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.560
94!

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:35.340
Draw!

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:39.120
I repeat, according to the three-judge decision,

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:42.350
the Japanese lightweight title match has ended in a draw!

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:45.260
Holy buckets, it’s a tie!

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:47.870
The champion defends his belt with a tie!

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:49.370
It won’t go to the challenger!

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:53.640
However, this match has kept us on the edges of our seats till the bitter end!

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:56.350
There are no losers in this brave struggle!

00:15:58.310 --> 00:15:59.820
Let’s go, Aoki.

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:04.100
<i>So I didn’t make it,</i>

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:05.870
<i>huh?</i>

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.680
Just like I predicted, they both lost!

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:16.880
P-Please say they both won.

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:19.470
There ain’t no winners in a slogfest!

00:16:20.550 --> 00:16:23.390
Even if it was a slogfest, I'm still moved!

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:27.600
To think this <i>drawn</i>  out slogfest would end in a <i>draw!</i>

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:29.640
Good one!

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:33.900
Quit screwing around and go cheer him up!

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.410
A-Aoki...

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:42.880
Look...

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:44.090
Now look...

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:44.910
You...

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:48.660
I fought thinking this was my last chance.

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:50.720
You didn’t lose!

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:52.360
It was really close!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.670
“Really close” ain’t making it any better.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:59.670
I didn’t get the belt. That’s all there is to it.

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:02.680
I think I’m...

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.930
Don’t say another word, Aoki!

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:12.200
Hey, what happened to your cheek?

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:15.290
Shaddap!

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:16.890
Your woman did this to me!

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.830
It’s all thanks to your screwy slogfest!

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:22.950
We don’t know which one of you 
sonuvabitching <i>losers</i>  even won!

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.780
You ruined everything!

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.090
You disgust me!

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:30.720
Way to pour salt on a wound!

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:32.160
This wasn’t the time or the place!

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:33.560
Don’t cry, Aoki!

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.120
Sachiko.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:58.410
I... finally realized,

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:00.900
you were always there looking after me.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:05.300
I was only able to keep going because of you.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.510
Forgive me, Sachiko!

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:11.910
Okay.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:20.490
Aoki-san!

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:25.430
<i>Now I get it.</i>

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:29.540
<i>So you got back your goddess of victory?</i>

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.430
<i>It all makes sense now.</i>

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.720
Thank you very much!

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:42.670
<i>Don’t thank me, fer chrissakes!</i>

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:45.180
<i>Hell, why didn't you beat me to a bloody pulp?</i>

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.950
<i>It woulda went down better.</i>

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.460
You did great, Masaru.

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:04.220
Tomiko!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:08.700
Don’t worry. I’ll make you feel <i>all</i>  better.

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:13.270
Are we clear, Takamura-san?

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:15.300
You’d better apologize!

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.820
I get it!

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:21.020
If Aoki-san says he’ll retire, 
it’s all your fault, Takamura-san!

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:22.780
You don’t have to remind me!

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:29.010
Dammit, why should I apologize to <i>him?</i>

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:30.200
Just do it!

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:36.650
I mean it, you were really hot!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.210
I was?

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:40.440
You almost made me swoon, Masaru!

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:45.040
Wow, now I know I’ll become the champion next time!

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:46.090
Of course you will!

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:47.350
Ow-ow-ow-ow!{I'm all swollen right there!  Tomiko: Oh, looks like you're all red and swollen here too!  Aoki: No, that's my...}

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:49.670
He sounds happy enough. This can wait.

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:51.120
It doesn’t look like he’ll retire.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.150
I agree.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:53.850
Yeah, this can wait.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:03.690
<i>Anyway, good job tonight, Aoki-san.</i>
